  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The bomb calorimeter is an instrument used to measure the heat of reaction at a fixed volume and the measured heat which is called the change of internal energy.<br />By combustion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> mole</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Heat</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>capacity</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mi>mass</mi></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>Molar</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mass</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>ng</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#916;nRT</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>225</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1006</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math></p><p>So heat released <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1006</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
